sequenceDiagram
    actor V as Voter
    participant UI as Frontend
    participant W as MetaMask
    participant SC as Smart Contract
    participant BC as Blockchain

    V->>UI: Open election (has existing ballot)
    UI->>SC: getBallot(electionId, voterAddress)
    SC-->>UI: Current ballot (pref1=A, pref2=C)
    UI->>UI: Display current preferences

    V->>UI: Select new 1st Preference (B)
    V->>UI: Keep 2nd Preference (C)
    V->>UI: Click "Review Changes"
    
    UI->>UI: Show comparison:<br/>Old: A, C → New: B, C

    V->>UI: Click "Confirm Modification"
    UI->>SC: modifyBallot(electionId, B, C)
    SC->>W: Request signature
    W->>V: MetaMask popup
    V->>W: Approve

    W->>BC: Submit transaction

    Note over SC: Validation:<br/>1. Election active ✓<br/>2. Voter eligible ✓<br/>3. Has existing ballot ✓<br/>4. Valid candidates ✓<br/>5. No duplicate prefs ✓

    SC->>SC: Decrement old tallies:<br/>Candidate A primaryVotes--<br/>Candidate C secondaryVotes--
    
    SC->>SC: Update ballot:<br/>firstPref = B<br/>secondPref = C
    
    SC->>SC: Increment new tallies:<br/>Candidate B primaryVotes++<br/>Candidate C secondaryVotes++
    
    SC->>BC: Emit BallotModified event:<br/>(electionId, voter, oldPref1=A,<br/>oldPref2=C, newPref1=B, newPref2=C)

    BC-->>UI: Transaction confirmed
    UI-->>V: "Ballot Modified Successfully"

    Note over BC: Blockchain preserves both:<br/>Block 100: BallotCast(A, C)<br/>Block 105: BallotModified(A,C → B,C)<br/>Nothing is erased.
